 "text": "Government of India\nEnglish (English)\nAPI Directory\nAbout Us\nExplore APIs\nResources\nExplore by Sector\nBlog\nDashboard\nLog In\nCreate Account\n Back\nNyaykosh-NeGD\n DelhiCentral GovernmentGovernment & Public SectorLegal & Judiciary\n\nSubscribe\n\nAPIs CollectionsAbout\nTry in Sandbox\nNyaykosh - Indian Legislation & Compliance Simulator API\nGet Act\nGet Site\nGet Navigation\nList Acts\nGet Law Xml\nEvaluate\nGet Law Personas\nList Personas\nGet Law Provisions\nGet Persona\nHealth\nGet Law\nGet Law Provision\nGet Categories\nGet Act Rules\nGet Law Pdf\nGet Law Amendments\nGet Law Penalties\nList Laws\nNyaykosh APIs\nNyaykosh - Indian Legislation & Compliance Simulat...Get Act\nDocumentationPerformanceAlertsAPIs Consumers\nSelect Code Snippet\nC\nC#-restsharp\nC#-httpclient\nGo\nJava-asynchttp\nJava-nethttp\nkotlin\nJava-unirest\nJavaScript-jquery\nJavaScript-xhr\nNodeJs-native\nNodeJs-request\nNodeJs-unirest\nNodeJs-axios\nNodeJs-fetch\nobjc-nsurlsession\nOCaml-cohttp\nPHP-curl\nPHP-http1\nPHP-http2\nPowerShell-webrequest\nPowerShell-restmethod\nPython-python3\nPython-requests\nR\nRuby\nShell-curl\nShell-httpie\nShell-wget\nSwift-nsurlsession\nNyaykosh - Indian Legislation & Compliance Simulator API\n 1.0.0 \nOAS 3.0\n\nOpen-access REST API for Indian legislation (Nyaykosh): a machine-readable\ncatalogue of Acts with their provisions, personas, amendments and penalties,\nplus a compliance simulator that evaluates a persona's answers against the\ncodified rules of an Act.\n\n\n\n\n[Updated on 14th August 2026]\n\nContact Nyaykosh API Support\nGovernment Open Data License - India GODL\nServers\nhttps://lawascode.negd.in/laac-api - Production\nContent\n\nSite content used by the front end (branding, navigation, categories) and the public read-only view of Acts and their codified rules under /v1/public/acts.\n\nGET\n/v1/site\nGet Site\nGET\n/v1/navigation\nGet Navigation\nGET\n/v1/categories\nGet Categories\nGET\n/v1/public/acts\nList Acts\nGET\n/v1/public/acts/{act_id}\nGet Act\nGET\n/v1/public/acts/{act_id}/rules\nGet Act Rules\nLaws\n\nPublic catalogue of Acts - details, provisions, personas, amendments, penalties, and XML/PDF exports.\n\nGET\n/v1/laws\nList Laws\nGET\n/v1/laws/{slug}\nGet Law\nGET\n/v1/laws/{slug}/penalties\nGet Law Penalties\nGET\n/v1/laws/{slug}/provisions\nGet Law Provisions\nGET\n/v1/laws/{slug}/personas\nGet Law Personas\nGET\n/v1/laws/{slug}/amendments\nGet Law Amendments\nGET\n/v1/laws/{slug}/provisions/{provision_slug}\nGet Law Provision\nGET\n/v1/laws/{slug}/xml\nGet Law Xml\nGET\n/v1/laws/{slug}/pdf\nGet Law Pdf\nMeta\n\nService health and liveness.\n\nGET\n/health\nHealth\nSimulator\n\nCompliance simulator - personas, their questionnaires, and rule evaluation.\n\nGET\n/v1/simulator/personas\nList Personas\nGET\n/v1/simulator/personas/{persona_id}\nGet Persona\nPOST\n/v1/simulator/evaluate\nEvaluate\nSchemas\nActAmendment\nActChapter\nActDetail\nActImportResult\nActLink\nActPersona\nActPersonaCreate\nActRule\nActSection\nActSectionCreate\nActSummary\nAdminProfile\nAdminStats\nAmendmentCreate\nBody_commit_act_import_v1_admin_acts_import_post\nBody_commit_import_v1_admin_rules_import_post\nBody_preview_act_import_v1_admin_acts_import_preview_post\nBody_preview_import_v1_admin_rules_preview_post\nBody_update_act_xml_v1_admin_acts__act_id__xml_put\nComplianceRule\nHTTPValidationError\nImportCommitResult\nImportIssue\nImportPreview\nLaw\nLawCreate\nLawUpdate\nLoginRequest\nNavLink\nPenalty\nPermissionOut\nPersona\nProvision\nRoleCreate\nRoleOut\nRoleUpdate\nRuleResult\nSimulateRequest\nSimulatorResult\nTokenResponse\nTriggerEvent\nUserActiveUpdate\nUserCreate\nUserDetail\nUserOut\nUserPasswordUpdate\nUserPermissionsUpdate\nUserRoleUpdate\nValidationError\nAbout Us\nExplore APIs\nSOP for API Access\nBlog\nFAQs\nDashboard\nUtilities\nAPI Policy\nData Standards\nDevelopers\nDigilocker\nInformation Videos\nPowered By\n\nDigital India Corporation (DIC)\n\nNational e-Governance Division (NeGD) Ministry of Electronics & IT (MeitY) Government of India\n\nWebsite designed & developed by National eGovernance Division (NeGD)\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Use\nContact Us\n\nAPIs | APISetu",
